<title>NEW ZEALAND: Telecom says bought back at NZ$7.08/shr.</title>
<headline>Telecom says bought back at NZ$7.08/shr.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Telecom Corp of New Zealand said on Monday it had acquired 971,458 ordinary shares off market at NZ$7.08 during June 13 pursuant to its $1 billion share buyback programme.</p>
<p>It also bought just over 975,000 shares on market at between NZ$7.07 and $7.25 on the same day.</p>
<p>--Wellington Newsroom (64 4) 4734746</p>
</text>
